================================================================================
Hypa-authored extensions
================================================================================
Captures for field, constructor, enum (+ members), struct, record, event,
file-scoped namespace, primary-constructor parameter lists, type parameters,
calls, imports, and base-list relationships that are not covered by the packs
above were authored for Hypa and are original work.

TypeScript / TSX extensions: class/abstract class, type alias, enum + members,
fields, constructors (method_definition named constructor), interface
property/method signatures, namespace/module, arrow/const function bindings,
type parameters, private member names, named exports, extends/implements heritage,
override, imports, and calls
not covered by the upstream packs above were authored for Hypa.
